[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11340.23, "timestamp": "03:09:00", "text": "就像周围的小音符一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11342.15, "timestamp": "03:09:02", "text": "那就是徽章，对吧？这"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11344.95, "timestamp": "03:09:04", "text": "小音符。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11347.11, "timestamp": "03:09:07", "text": "太可爱了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11349.349, "timestamp": "03:09:09", "text": "完美。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11352.15, "timestamp": "03:09:12", "text": "是的。希望一切顺利。但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11353.67, "timestamp": "03:09:13", "text": "是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11358.87, "timestamp": "03:09:18", "text": "非常勤奋。嗯，你知道吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11360.95, "timestamp": "03:09:20", "text": "你想要。所以，我觉得这很好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11363.269, "timestamp": "03:09:23", "text": "我喜欢有目标，也喜欢工作。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11365.51, "timestamp": "03:09:25", "text": "朝着这个方向发展就像很多"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11368.15, "timestamp": "03:09:28", "text": "总比漫无目的地走要好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11371.59, "timestamp": "03:09:31", "text": "哦，我尝试过很多事情。是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11374.15, "timestamp": "03:09:34", "text": "因为障碍就在这里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11377.75, "timestamp": "03:09:37", "text": "在那里，我意识到了自己的局限"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11380.79, "timestamp": "03:09:40", "text": "因为我更像是个多面手，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11383.83, "timestamp": "03:09:43", "text": "奈大师。我涉猎广泛"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11386.71, "timestamp": "03:09:46", "text": "事情，嗯，我没法完全完成它。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11389.51, "timestamp": "03:09:49", "text": "就是那种感觉，然后我意识到我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11393.03, "timestamp": "03:09:53", "text": "我需要别人的帮助，但我做不到。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11395.75, "timestamp": "03:09:55", "text": "这一切都是我自己做的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11397.67, "timestamp": "03:09:57", "text": "正确的。是的。"}]